BEGIN_PGML Now consider the sum
[``` S_n = 1 + \frac14 + \left(\frac14\right)^2 + \left(\frac14\right)^3 + \cdots + \left(\frac14\right)^{n-1} \text{.}```]
Do you think this sum is larger or smaller than the sum we first considered?
[_]{$radio}{5}
What about
[``` S_n = 1 - \frac12 + \left(\frac12\right)^2 - \left(\frac12\right)^3 + \cdots + \left(-\frac12\right)^{n-1} \text{?}```]
Do you think this sum is larger or smaller than the sum we first considered?
